; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[∵ cos( - &theta;) = cos&theta;]</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 1/cos(180&deg; + 45&deg;) = x</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; - 1/cos(45&deg;) = x</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x = - 1/(1/&radic;2)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [∵ cos45&deg; = 1/&radic;2]</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x = - &radic;2</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The required value of x is (-&nbsp;&radic;2).</strong></p>\n",
