      "question": "cos (1230&deg;) =?",
      "questionHtml": "cos (1230&deg;) =?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{{\\sqrt 3 }}{2}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{\\sqrt 3 }}{2}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{{ - \\sqrt 3 }}{2}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{ - \\sqrt 3 }}{2}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{1}{2}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{2}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{{ - 1}}{2}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{ - 1}}{2}\\)</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong><u>Concept:</u></strong></p>\n\n<p>cos (2n&pi; + &theta;) = cos &theta;</p>\n\n<p>cos (&pi; - &theta;) = -cos &theta;</p>\n\n<p><strong><u>Calculation:</u></strong></p>\n\n<p>cos (1230&deg;)</p>\n\n<p>= cos (3 &times; 360&deg; + 150&deg;)</p>\n\n<p>= cos (150&deg;)</p>\n\n<p>= cos (180&deg; - 30&deg;)</p>\n\n<p>= - cos (30&deg;)</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(= - \\frac{{\\sqrt 3 }}{2}\\)</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b17b5ffad999-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "If sin&theta; = 1/2, then find the value of \\(\\frac{{{{\\sin }^2}θ \\; + \\;{{\\cos }^2}θ \\; + \\;{{\\tan }^2}θ \\;}}{{{\\cos}^2 θ \\; + \\;cosec\\;θ -\\sin θ }}.\\)",
      "questionHtml": "If sin&theta;&nbsp;= 1/2, then find the value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{{{\\sin }^2}θ \\; + \\;{{\\cos }^2}θ \\; + \\;{{\\tan }^2}θ \\;}}{{{\\cos}^2 θ \\; + \\;cosec\\;θ -\\sin θ }}.\\)</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "16/15",
          "html": "16/15"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "15/27",
          "html": "15/27"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "20/21",
          "html": "20/21"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "16/27",
          "html": "16/27"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>By using Pythagoras theorem</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(b = \\sqrt {{h^2} - {p^2}}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\Rightarrow b = \\sqrt {{2^2} - {1^2}}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>⇒ b = √3</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\Rightarrow \\;\\frac{{{{\\left( {\\frac{1}{2}} \\right)}^{2}} + {{\\left( {\\frac{{\\sqrt 3 }}{2}} \\right)}^2} + {{\\left( {\\frac{1}{{\\sqrt 3 }}} \\right)}^2}}}{{{{\\left( {\\frac{{\\sqrt 3 }}{2}} \\right)}^2} + 2-\\frac{1}{2}}}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>⇒ 16/27</p>\n",
