      "question": "Find the value of cos 47&deg; sec 133&deg; + sin 44&deg; cosec 136&deg;.",
      "questionHtml": "Find the value of cos 47&deg; sec 133&deg; + sin 44&deg; cosec 136&deg;.",
      "options": [
        {
