    {
      "id": "b17b5ffad999-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "Find the value of tan 15&deg; + cot 15&deg;",
      "questionHtml": "Find the value of tan 15&deg; + cot 15&deg;",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "4",
          "html": "4"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "6",
          "html": "6"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "8",
          "html": "8"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">cot15° + tan15° ⇒ (cos15°/sin15°) + (sin15°/cos15°)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ (cos<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>15° + sin<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2 </span>15°)/(sin15° cos 15°) ⇒ 1/(sin15° cos15°)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Multiply and divide equation by 2 ⇒ 2/(2 sin15° cos15°) ⇒ 2/sin30° ⇒ (2/1/2) = 2 × 2 ⇒ 4</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
