    {
      "id": "b17b5ffad999-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "If secC = cosec(C &ndash; 30&deg;), find the value of cotC &ndash; tanC.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>If secC = cosec(C &ndash; 30&deg;), find the value of cotC &ndash; tanC.</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "4/&radic;3",
          "html": "4/&radic;3"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "-&radic;3/2",
          "html": "-&radic;3/2"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "-2/&radic;3",
          "html": "-2/&radic;3"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "3/&radic;2",
          "html": "3/&radic;2"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>secC = cosec(C &ndash; 30&deg;)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Concepts used:</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/604ee93f5c9663cd7eb6d593_16425678162051.png\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/604ee93f5c9663cd7eb6d593_16425678162072.png\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>secC = cosec(C &ndash; 30&deg;)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; secC = sec(90&deg; - (C &ndash; 30&deg;))</p>\n\n<p>On comparing,</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; C = 90&deg; + 30&deg; - C</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 2C = 120&deg;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; C = 60&deg;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;cotC &ndash; tanC = cot60&deg; - tan60&deg; = (1/&radic;3) &ndash; (&radic;3) = -2/&radic;3</p>\n\n<p><strong>&nbsp;&there4; Value of cotC &ndash; tanC is -2/&radic;3.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/604ee93f5c9663cd7eb6d593_16425678162051.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/604ee93f5c9663cd7eb6d593_16425678162072.png"
      ],
